│    ⏱️  Duration: [X] min                          │
│                                                     │
│ 2️⃣ [Service Name] #[id] ✓                        │
│    📆 [Day], [DD month] | ⏰ [HH:MM]             │
│    ⏱️  Duration: [X] min                          │
